OL,3,ANew Zealand PM says election 'too close
OL,4,Ato call' as 99% of votes counted
OL,5,
OL,6,FVotes are being counted in New Zealand,
OL,7,Fwith incumbent PM Christopher Luxon's
OL,8,Fcentre-right National Party and Chris
OL,9,FHipkins' centre-left Labour Party
OL,10,Fcurrently neck-and-neck - see the
OL,11,Fpreliminary results
OL,13,FBoth parties are calling for compromise
OL,14,Fas the vote tallies show the election
OL,15,Fis too close to call - what they've
OL,16,Ftold supporters
OL,18,FThe latest electoral commission data
OL,19,Fsuggests a slight lead for National -
OL,20,Fhere's why we won't know the full
OL,21,Fresults until later this month
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
