OL,3,ANew Zealand PM says election 'too close
OL,4,Ato call' as 99% of votes counted
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the centrist Opportunity
OL,7,FParty crosses the 5% threshold to enter
OL,8,Fparliament for the first time as the
OL,9,Fmajor parties see historically low
OL,10,Fvotes
OL,12,FNew Zealand's voting system - mixed
OL,13,Fmember proportional - means most
OL,14,Fgovernments are coalitions
OL,16,FSymone, 28, says most of her friends
OL,17,Fhave left New Zealand or are
OL,18,Fconsidering leaving. She tells our
OL,19,Freporter in Wellington: "I think we're
OL,20,Fall tired... that's one of the reasons
OL,21,FI want change"
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
